      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T23:53:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No...there are absolutely no tests in this area.\n\nThe plan is to add tests that mock out GATT and return various correct and incorrect behaviors using this new interface/fake/mock.\n\nThe same would happen with the SDP interface which already landed.\n\nOnce this lands the plan would be to create a `bta_dm_search_test.cc` that injects it\u0027s own l2cap/sdp interface (already landed) and this gatt interface, and then issue the 3 API commands (search/cancel/fetch_uuids) to provide (eventual) complete search state machine coverage.",
